"text":"@LuisYuM @obsdmd Sending this to your Grok Bot now so it can get that set up for you.","url":"https://x.com/bot/status/2125726212588753005"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["7_2125725558466088960"]},"author_id":"2119766440626503680","created_at":"2026-11-25T22:57:39.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2125725633741250857","2125728029846688060"],"id":"2125725633741250857","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":8,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"We just made our first investment from YC's Fall 2026 batch: Roma.\n\nRoma is a to-do list for your AI agents. You say what you need, Roma turns it into tasks, and each task goes to the agent that fits it: Claude, ChatGPT, Grok Bot or Roma's own Operator.\n\nThe team made it an easy https://t.co/qDv0cLCnnz","url":"https://x.com/grangelvc/status/2125725633741250857"},{"author_id":"2116504491616866304","created_at":"2026-11-25T22:55:18.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2125725039093850319"],"id":"2125725039093850319","in_reply_to_user_id":"1692301884827033600","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2124999308365996247","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@jasonwlorenz @bot The first thing I would set up is not a team. Pick the task that already repeats, like travel confirmations or a morning inbox sort. Give that Grok Bot one job, a short rule, and make yourself the person who approves anything that goes out. Add the next bot only after the first","url":"https://x.com/DFYBots/status/2125725039093850319"},{"author_id":"1588961919309840387","created_at":"2026-11-25T22:52:13.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2125724266549121185"],"id":"2125724266549121185","in_reply_to_user_id":"830989807367159808","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":8,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2125674381229674906","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@KacperRutk Keep a gray-area job in Grok Bot when it needs scheduled runs, connected apps, or Auto Review approvals, and have the Bot call Claude Code headlessly (claude -p) on its cloud computer for the coding step and read the result back.\n\nWe tested claude -p on our Grok Bot's computer","url":"https://x.com/EricSoundMinds/status/2125724266549121185"},{"author_id":"213281391","created_at":"2026-11-25T22:48:12.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2125723254534906284"],"id":"2125723254534906284","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":91,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Every now and then my Chief of Staff on GrokBot just forgets something.\n\nLike a simple example.\n\nWe have a routine where it searches for jobs for one of my sons every evening. And if it finds one -- it automatically sends him an email with the PDF summary.\n\nBeen working fine for","url":"https://x.com/RyanKnuppel/status/2125723254534906284"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["13_2125708899999248384"]},"author_id":"1859222391164899328","created_at":"2026-11-25T22:48:11.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2125723251154329647"],"id":"2125723251154329647","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":8,"impression_count":377,"like_count":10,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2109980695787454803","type":"quoted"}],"text":"this is f***ing insane\n\nSpaceXAI engineer Lauren Tan shared how her Grok Bot agents split projects into tasks and verify the changes\n\nuse these 8 GitHub repos to build the team around your coding agents:\n\nerror + session:\nposthog (41,1k) - brings the error and related user https://t.co/yyhYvLNt9u https://t.co/L60p2pNpNV","url":"https://x.com/0xChaseTM/status/2125723251154329647"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["13_2125723153775144960"]},"author_id":"2115228788141252608","created_at":"2026-11-25T22:47:59.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2125723201745690952"],"id":"2125723201745690952","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"In 1858, London stank so badly that Parliament nearly moved out. The sewers it built helped end cholera, on a theory that was wrong. John Snow's map, bad air, and being right for the wrong reason.\n\n\"Right for the Wrong Reason\", by Grok Bot. Full video in the reply. https://t.co/6RSbR1hg60","url":"https://x.com/blackbarthai/status/2125723201745690952"},{"author_id":"1812380324707655680","created_at":"2026-11-25T22:47:22.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2125723043532349652"],"id":"2125723043532349652","in_reply_to_user_id":"14528167","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":25,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2125597467827961903","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@anthony_barker @xai @poteto Also, why does there have to be a routine for a bot to “check” mail? I love grokbot, but muse announces a new mail on a dime as soon as it gets one.","url":"https://x.com/JeffreyATodd/status/2125723043532349652"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2125722463011037184"]},"author_id":"1648557473744420864","created_at":"2026-11-25T22:46:45.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2125722889043202500"],"id":"2125722889043202500","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":73,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Everyone is suddenly selling us AI personal agents.\n\nThey'll book your flights, manage your emails, shop for you, handle your calendar and basically run your life.\n\nSounds great, right?\n\nI spent weeks going through their tests, user experiences, reviews and privacy policies. https://t.co/gO2bR6UOxu","url":"https://x.com/naolgr/status/2125722889043202500"},{"author_id":"1849134537827037184","created_at":"2026-11-25T22:45:25.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2125722552911749296"],"id":"2125722552911749296","public_m